      {"kind": "text", "slot": "kicker", "rect": [40, 155.51, 348.67, 12], "style": "Kicker", "sample": "Operations"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "title", "rect": [40, 165.46, 348.67, 64], "style": "Lead Title", "sample": "Tacoma opens its doors two weeks early"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "subtitle", "rect": [40, 230.73, 348.67, 33], "style": "Lead Deck", "sample": "Our third warehouse went live on 2 September. Here is what the team learned on the way, and what comes next."},
      {"kind": "image", "slot": "hero", "rect": [40, 275, 348.67, 176]},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "caption", "rect": [40, 456.58, 348.67, 12], "style": "Caption", "sample": "The first outbound trailer leaves Tacoma at 6.10 am on opening day."},
      {"kind": "text", "flow": "body", "rect": [40, 479, 348.67, 259], "style": "NL Body", "columns": 2, "gutter": 18, "sample": ["When the Tacoma site was signed off in February, the plan was simple: racking in by July, systems live in August, first orders on 15 September. The team beat that date by thirteen days.", "Most of the time was saved in the yard. Instead of waiting for the full fleet, the transport team ran a shuttle with four borrowed trailers, letting the floor crews test real loads a month ahead of schedule.", "Site manager Priya Desai credits the early start to the people who volunteered from Portland and Boise for the first fortnight. Around sixty colleagues spent time on site, and most of them asked to come back.", "Tacoma will handle all orders for Washington and northern Oregon from October, cutting average delivery times in the region by almost a day.", "The building itself has a few firsts for us: solar panels across the whole roof, rainwater collection for the truck wash and a staff room with a view of the sound that has already caused a few long lunches.", "There is still work to do. The second mezzanine opens in January, and the team is hiring for twenty more roles before the holiday peak. If you know someone who would fit in, tell the People team."]},
      {"kind": "text", "rect": [406.67, 155.51, 165.33, 12], "style": "Side Label", "text": "In this issue"},
      {"kind": "line", "from": [406.67, 168], "to": [572, 168], "stroke": {"color": "accent", "weight": 0.75}},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "list", "rect": [406.67, 178.96, 165.33, 65], "style": "Index", "sample": ["• Tacoma opens two weeks early", "• A night on Dock 4", "• Dates for the diary", "• New faces this quarter"]},
      {"kind": "rect", "rect": [406.67, 260, 165.33, 214], "fill": "tint"},
      {"kind": "text", "rect": [418.67, 271.51, 141.33, 12], "style": "Side Label", "text": "The quarter in numbers"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "stat1", "rect": [418.67, 285.92, 141.33, 34], "style": "Stat Big", "sample": "98.2%"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "stat1.label", "rect": [418.67, 318.44, 141.33, 24], "style": "Stat Text", "sample": "of orders delivered on time, our best quarter yet"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "stat2", "rect": [418.67, 350.92, 141.33, 34], "style": "Stat Big", "sample": "41"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "stat2.label", "rect": [418.67, 383.44, 141.33, 24], "style": "Stat Text", "sample": "new colleagues welcomed across three sites"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "stat3", "rect": [418.67, 415.92, 141.33, 34], "style": "Stat Big", "sample": "212"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "stat3.label", "rect": [418.67, 448.44, 141.33, 13], "style": "Stat Text", "sample": "days without a lost-time injury"},
      {"kind": "line", "from": [406.67, 484], "to": [438.67, 484], "stroke": {"color": "accent", "weight": 2}},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "quote", "rect": [406.67, 491.5, 165.33, 56], "style": "Pull", "sample": "We grew without cutting a single corner. That is the part I am proudest of."},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "quotecredit", "rect": [406.67, 550.95, 165.33, 22], "style": "Pull Credit", "sample": ["Dana Whitcombe", "Chief Executive"]},
