      {"kind": "text", "slot": "feature1.title", "rect": [40, 271.48, 348.67, 28], "style": "Feature Title", "sample": "A night on Dock 4"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "feature1.body", "rect": [40, 302.82, 348.67, 121], "style": "NL Body", "columns": 2, "gutter": 18, "sample": ["At ten past eleven the day crew hands over, and Dock 4 changes pace. The night shift moves almost half of everything we ship, and does it with the lights low and the radio on.", "Shift lead Marco Silva has run the team for six years. He knows every driver by name and most of their dogs. The secret, he says, is a proper break at two and nobody leaving a pallet half wrapped.", "This summer the team trialled a new pick route that cut walking by a third. It is now being rolled out to every site."]},
      {"kind": "line", "from": [40, 436], "to": [388.67, 436], "stroke": {"color": "muted", "weight": 0.5}},
      {"kind": "image", "slot": "image2", "rect": [40, 450, 165.33, 96]},
      {"kind": "text", "rect": [40, 559.51, 165.33, 12], "style": "Side Label", "text": "Safety"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "feature2.title", "rect": [40, 573.18, 165.33, 21], "style": "Story Title", "sample": "Safety first, again"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "feature2.body", "rect": [40, 597.17, 165.33, 132], "style": "NL Body", "sample": ["Tacoma joins Portland and Boise with a full year of the new safety walk, a ten-minute tour of each zone at the start of every shift.", "Reported near misses are up, which is exactly what we hoped for: problems are being spotted before anyone gets hurt. Thank you to every team that took part."]},
      {"kind": "image", "slot": "image3", "rect": [223.33, 450, 165.33, 96]},
      {"kind": "text", "rect": [223.33, 559.51, 165.33, 12], "style": "Side Label", "text": "Fleet"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "feature3.title", "rect": [223.33, 573.18, 165.33, 21], "style": "Story Title", "sample": "Greener yards"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "feature3.body", "rect": [223.33, 597.17, 165.33, 118], "style": "NL Body", "sample": ["Twelve electric yard tractors arrive in November, replacing our oldest diesel units at all three sites.", "They are quieter, cheaper to run and, according to the Boise crew who tested the first one, a lot more fun to drive. Charging bays are being fitted now."]},
